  "changes": [
    "Validate typed bounded source structure and retain it in optional document provenance returned by actual extraction-to-index path",
    "Migrate schema48 to49 with one nullable sources column through the existing transactional migration dispatcher; historical rows retain NULL",
    "Persist and replace structure atomically with source, FTS and vocabulary; existing purge owners remove the same source row",
    "Return structure after reopen and every search fallback, rejecting corrupt/orphaned or mismatched metadata",
    "Bound structure JSON to256KiB and aggregate actual stored structure payload to1MiB per search response, counting repeated source hits; reject overflowing SQLite LIMIT"
  ],
